204
00:14:26,486 --> 00:14:31,287
hand: for each method, the number of
commits main gains, the number of merge

205
00:14:31,327 --> 00:14:36,637
commits, whether the tree IDs will be equal,
and whether your head commit will be an

206
00:14:36,677 --> 00:14:41,414
